📝 NOTES SECTION
===============================================================================

Key Concepts to Remember:
• String immutability - every operation creates a new object
• Use StringBuilder for multiple concatenations
• equals() vs == for string comparison
• Character class utilities for analysis
• Regular expressions for complex pattern matching

Common Pitfalls to Avoid:
• Using == instead of equals() for content comparison
• Inefficient string concatenation in loops
• Not handling null strings
• Forgetting string indices are 0-based
• Case sensitivity issues in comparisons

